altcha-widget-v1.min.js
  ALTCHA widget 0.2.0 (MIT). Same file ZHC serves at /shared/altcha-widget-v1.min.js.

zhc-prefs.css
  Appearance crib from zhc.fdh.bz /shared/zhc-prefs.css (Todd). Selectors stay
  data-zhc-theme so the chrome matches signup. Cookie prefix comes from
  the picobus-cookie meta tag (default PICOBUS).

crew-prefs.js
  Theme toggle + cookie tray for the signup page. Cookie {PREFIX}_THEME_{PROD|DEV|QA}.

dc/chrome.js, dc/chrome.css, dc/icons/
  Copy of the site menu, appearance control, and cookie tray for /dc/.
  Theme cookie is ZHCTHEME_*, same as zhc.fdh.bz. Icons are served by picobus.
  Not loaded from /shared/.

altcha-http-shim.js
  crypto.subtle SHA-256 polyfill + disable Workers on plain HTTP so the
  official widget can solve on the LAN demo (not a secure context).
